  "description": "Carefully tailored lightweight components and a more upright traditional Road riding posture with female frames taken into consideration, our Osprey WSD gives you a unique Road ride that maximizes women’s performance. Whether you’re climbing the winding country roads or commuting to your city job, this is the ideal go-to bike for the rider who likes to fly.\nOur Reid Osprey WSD (Women Specific Design) is the perfect fit for female riders looking for a long distance or fast, everyday use road bike.\nMost road bikes are designed with a male rider in mind, yet the average female body has very different proportions which affect how a bike fits and feels. WSD is an approach to building bikes that starts from the ground up to better suit a female rider – from frame geometry to crank choice to all the touch-points. Everything about the Reid Osprey WSD is reconsidered to better suit a female rider.",
